00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:02.060
What?

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.610
A pincer attack?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.710
So that's the prophesied Ovid of yore...

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:31.510
Vox.

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:35.970
It's beautiful.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:41.310
The Ovid that has entered Kamogawa's airspace has been confirmed as an enemy combatant. {merged}

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:42.640
It will be designated as unit three.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:45.310
Issue an order to the pilot immediately!

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:47.480
Tell her to get out of the vicinity!

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.230
<i>Hey, you! Black robot over there!</i>

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>Watch what you're doing!</i>

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:55.320
That's the town where Uncle Hiroshi and Ms. Machiko, Sachi, Michi,

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:59.870
Erika, and all the others live!

