00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.010
I'm coming to save you...

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:37.630
Kamogawa!

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.430
Let's see what you're made of.

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:44.010
The legendary Ovid and its pledged pilot.

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:53.610
<i>Vox Aura is now engaged in close-range combat with enemy unit three.</i>

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:55.780
Lan Blooms in Kamogawa {sign}

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:57.400
<i>The Municipal Fire and Disaster Management Department has issued</i>

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.530
<i>an evacuation order to all Kamogawa residents.</i>

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.210
Can you do it, my lady?

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:26.310
You fear the legend.

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:29.810
Can you really accept the Vox in your current state?

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:32.730
It's not possible, is it?

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:36.690
You've tried countless times and yet you were unable to activate the Vox System. {merged}

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.490
You couldn't transform Lympha into Warrior Mode.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:50.660
My lady, you weren't able to overcome your fear.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:58.000
Madoka doesn't know about the legend.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:01.510
That's why she can pilot Aura so well.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:03.340
That's right.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:05.720
She doesn't know.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.720
We have lost track of enemy unit two.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:12.140
There are currently two enemy Ovid within the battle zone.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.310
So the first one is underwater.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:18.520
Do you suppose it's an attempt to rescue the detained unit one and its pilot? {merged}

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:23.150
Expand sea gauge sensors of the surrounding area to full scale!

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:25.610
Force Vox Aura back into Piercer Mode!

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:28.830
Get her out of the area by using the A.I. remote.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:29.910
It's no use, sir!

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:35.040
Our signals are being overridden by the pilot's Telepathic Control Waves.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:39.090
Great... If only a certain princess was a little more useful,

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:43.340
we wouldn't have to rely on a complete amateur to handle everything on her own!{merged}

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.930
Whoa!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.770
I'm not done yet!

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:19.130
Is this the power of the Vox?

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.340
She's been hit.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:38.940
Ouch! I should've asked Erika to let me practice that move.

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.820
Oh no!

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.150
Grandpa Nagase's peanut farm!

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.320
I'm so sorry, old man.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:49.530
I'll treat you to some grilled hijiki with sesame some time!

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.930
<i>You are indeed worthy to be the pilot of the Vox.</i>

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:15.680
<i>You instantly reacted to my Non-Lethal Mode Strike and boldly took action.</i> {merged/split}

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:16.520
<i>I'm impressed.</i>

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:17.140
Huh?

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:19.770
I've never seen such a move.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.480
Are you, by any chance, a pilot of this planet?

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.020
<i>So what if I am?</i>

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:26.320
This is a warning.

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:29.950
I don't know what you were told by Le Garite,

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:34.330
but we do not intend to harm you people.

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.580
We only want you to come with us to our planet.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:38.870
<i>How about an "I'm sorry"?</i>{unclear if this should be "a" or "an", but shouldn't really matter}

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:43.130
First, to Grandpa Nagase and his peanut farm.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:46.050
Second, to everyone in Kamogawa. You owe them an apology!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:47.300
<i>Never mind that.</i>

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.510
"Never mind that"?

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:53.140
<i>You drop literally out of the blue and scare everyone half to death.</i>

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.640
<i>Who do you think you are? Huh?</i>

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.680
<i>You think the crisis on your planet is more important?!</i>

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.350
<i>What's that supposed to mean?</i>

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:02.230
Why can't we hear the enemy transmission?

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.560
It must be a secure line.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:06.110
<i>What do you mean "big and small"?</i>

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:12.620
<i>The love people have for this town is just as strong as the one you feel for your home world!</i>

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:18.950
So you're saying you won't listen to my behest?

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:24.540
You're in for a surprise if you think the Jersey Club indiscriminately hears out all requests! {merged}

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:26.670
<i>Jersey Club?</i>

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:30.670
So please allow me to turn you down.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.180
That's unfortunate.

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.220
You leave me no choice.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:41.190
I'll just have to take it by force!

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:57.080
If I remember correctly, the Ayanokoji family on 7th Street 
demolished their old house to rebuild a new one.{merged}

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.620
Their lot should be vacant now.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:05.080
I've got to hand it to them...

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.250
This is a really nice and large empty lot!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:14.640
<i>Vox Aura has resumed close-range combat with enemy unit three!</i>

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:21.270
If I didn't know about the fate that awaits those who fight alongside the Voxes...{merged}

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:22.810
I could fight like Madoka...

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:26.860
<i>Aura is unable to escape the enemy's assault!</i>

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:30.320
<i>The pilot's respiratory and circulatory readings will reach dangerous levels imminently!</i> {merged}

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:35.070
No, that's not it.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.370
She is...

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:55.380
I'm getting a warning from the Catapult Conveyor!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.180
What?!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.680
Vox Lympha has initiated T.O. sequence!

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:02.430
What are you trying to do, my lady?

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:05.140
<i>I already told you.</i>

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:08.690
<i>Nothing will be gained by having you join the battle.</i>

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:12.230
<i>While I may not achieve anything, there's still something I must do.</i>

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:18.320
<i>Because Madoka can't even be scared.</i>

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.660
<i>I dragged her into this!</i>

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:28.000
I can't get Lympha out of its self-select launch mode!

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:34.210
Fin E Ld Si Laffinty... Taking off!

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:02.330
Enemy unit two has reappeared from underwater.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:10.080
Another Vox... Sorry, Array.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:12.290
You'll have to wait a bit longer!

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.640
Damage to the ventral stabilizer!

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:21.850
Drag is increasing.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:22.760
Her speed is dropping.

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:29.440
Don't try anything stupid.

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:33.440
Kirius is busy playing with your friend over there!

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:39.660
Thank goodness!

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:42.120
There's no need to worry about the customers,

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:44.280
since this shop went out of business last week.

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:54.250
I don't get it.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.800
Why would she try such a hopeless move twice?

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:01.340
Is this some kind of ritual required of a pilot

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.300
who has made a vow to a Vox?

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:11.650
I thought it would work this time.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.270
Let me borrow this for a bit!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:21.950
How's this?

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:27.830
Choking an Ovid that doesn't even breathe?

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:31.080
They didn't teach this at the academy in De Metrio.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.670
Is it a finishing technique unique to this planet?

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:45.430
<i>Tanpopo Children's Park has been destroyed!</i>

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:50.520
Why isn't this one transforming?

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:51.480
Could it be?

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:11.750
I would think it's easier to fight in humanoid form.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.330
Why doesn't it transform?

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:18.500
That is because the pilot cannot transform Lympha into Warrior Mode.

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:23.380
You are Miss Kyouno Madoka's cousin...

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.760
Correct?

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:28.260
Youko!

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:29.810
What if I am?

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:32.430
I have a question.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.850
How did you convince Miss Madoka to get back on her feet?

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:39.860
I just made her remember something that should be obvious.

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.150
Obvious, you say?

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:44.280
To finish whatever you start.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.490
I guess you could call it the Jersey Club spirit.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.330
Jersey Club?

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:57.330
<i>When I hear a voice that touches my heart,</i>

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:02.260
<i>I'll put on my jersey and give it my best.</i>

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:05.930
<i>The end result alone isn't enough to inspire me.</i>

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:10.430
<i>I leave it up to my heart to decide,</i>

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:15.190
<i>on whether or not to take on a request.</i>

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:19.230
<i>Move forward! Run!</i>

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:23.190
<i>That's the Jersey Club spirit!</i>

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:28.320
<i>When the voice that touches your heart reaches you...</i>

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:32.290
<i>Put on your jersey and get ready!</i>

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:35.910
<i>Duty and justice alone aren't enough to convince me.</i>

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:35.910
Thank you... {I assume timer split lines like this already}

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:38.290
Success!

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.000
What?!

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.000
What?!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:42.670
<i>I leave it up to my heart to decide,</i>

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:45.380
<i>on whether or not to take on a request.</i>

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.630
Madoka?

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.630
<i>Don't run away.</i>

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.510
Are you serious?

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.510
<i>Keep going forward.</i>

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:53.600
<i>That's the Jersey Club spirit!</i>

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:58.650
<i>I want you to hear that voice too.</i>

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:01.230
It's a voice that has a passionate spirit...

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.730
<i>I'm sorry, Madoka!</i>

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.150
Lan?

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:08.490
<i>I've done such a terrible thing to you.</i>

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:11.450
Just because I can't do anything,

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:14.240
I've pushed everything onto you.

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.330
I'm sorry, Madoka!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.040
I'm so sorry.

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:25.550
<i>Lan, you smell like Jersey Club Spirit!</i>

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:31.180
<i>I mean, you came all the way out here just to tell me that, right?</i>

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:40.690
You're wrong, though.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.730
I'm not doing this for your sake.

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:46.360
I'm just finishing what I've started!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.950
<i>You haven't done anything wrong.</i>

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:52.030
So...

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:54.240
Put on a smile, comrade!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:31.490
Uh-oh!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:32.490
Madoka!

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:42.870
Damn it!

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:03.810
I completely forgot.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:10.030
I was so focused on reaching you that I forgot to be afraid...

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:14.910
I'm okay now, comrade.

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:19.330
Lympha's Vox System has been activated!

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:20.540
What?!

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:24.750
<i>All joint form systematics have been activated!</i>

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:34.630
<i>CSR Border Line at 70, 80, exceeding 90 percent!</i>

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:37.390
<i>Link with pilot's Bio Telepathic Control Waves successful!</i>

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.680
Huh? What? What?

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.180
Excuse me!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:22.640
The Ox thingy seems to be slowing down!

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:26.140
The craft was damaged during close-range combat.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.560
If she keeps sustaining direct blows...

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:32.440
Did you think my attacks were random?

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.700
The Non-Lethal Mode Strike is a technique in its own right.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:38.780
It's not flashy, but it's very effective.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:42.660
Let's put an end to this, shall we?!

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.930
Welcome, Lan!

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:03.270
Woof!

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:04.720
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:06.730
That's...

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:09.690
the second Legendary Weapon!

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.280
<i>Kirius!</i>

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:28.080
<i>It's too risky against two Voxes.</i> {Voxes->Voces, Latin 101}

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:31.840
We'll withdraw for now and wait for another opportunity.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:34.050
Damn it!

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:41.300
<i>Ovid units two and three are retreating!</i>

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:43.430
Area clear.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:55.820
It seems...

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:58.780
Miss Madoka and you...

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:00.780
have saved us.

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:02.320
I didn't do anything.

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:04.450
Don't be modest.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:08.330
Let's see, how can we thank you?

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:13.670
These are gate passes for this vessel!

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:31.810
Say, Lan...

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:33.020
Huh?

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:40.030
If I didn't agree to pilot Ox thingy, I might've gone crazy.

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:42.160
Standing helpless on the sidelines,

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:44.280
watching Kamogawa being destroyed.

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:47.910
Thanks to this robot,

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.540
I was able to save my dear city.

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:54.880
Thank you, Lan.

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:58.380
I should be saying that to you.

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.720
Thanks to you, I was able to overcome it.

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:06.180
Overcome what?

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:09.600
Come on, tell me, Lan.

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:11.020
You have it wrong, Madoka.

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:15.230
The robot's name isn't Ox.

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:17.520
Yeah, I know.

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:23.240
From today, her name is Midori!

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:25.780
Huh? Midori? Why?

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:29.700
We went through hell together!

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:32.370
That makes her my comrade, just like you!

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:35.000
Thus, she deserves a proper name.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.880
But why Midori?

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:40.170
Midori as in the color green, isn't that obvious? {TL Note: Midori is the worst web browser ever (maybe)}

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.380
Anyway, I'm counting on you, Midori!

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:53.690
I'm counting on you... Orca.

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:55.520
Huh? Why Orca?

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.150
Is that weird?

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:58.360
Yeah, it is.

00:20:58.360 --> 00:20:59.900
Weirder than Midori?

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:01.860
What? Is Midori weird?

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:02.780
A little...

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:04.490
Huh? You think so?

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:06.660
I think Orca sounds weirder.

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:13.870
It's an old tale, from ancient times.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:17.290
The giant green demon will rip the heavens...

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:20.380
The giant blue demon will devour the stars...

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:23.880
The giant orange demon will spew out darkness...

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:26.890
Through countless sacrifices, they will rule the land.

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.050
Feeding off a tainted heart,

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:32.720
they awaken from within the mind.

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:33.890
The demons shall then rise.

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:36.270
Do not let them loose.

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:39.520
